  "body": "Tucked privately in a peaceful cul-de-sac and just an easy walk to Macleans College, this stunning residence offers modern luxury and versatile living on a sunny 376sqm section with approx. 299sqm floor area.\r\n \r\nDesigned for extended families, this fantastic home features 6 bedrooms, 3 living areas, 2 legal kitchens and 4 bathrooms (2 ensuites) — a spacious 4-bedroom main home plus a fully self-contained 2-bedroom granny flat.\r\n \r\nStep inside to a light-filled open-plan living and dining area flowing seamlessly to the deck — perfect for entertaining. The designer kitchen showcases premium appliances and a large island bench, while the fully fenced section with security gate and landscaped garden ensures privacy and safety.\r\n \r\nThe separate 2-bedroom flat has its own entrance and includes a living area, kitchen and stylish bathroom — ideal for grandparents, teenagers or guests.\r\n \r\nUpstairs offers excellent separation with a generous family lounge and wet bar for relaxing or hosting. Four well-appointed bedrooms sit privately on one wing, including a luxurious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and spa bathroom. A wrap-around balcony connects 3 bedrooms, extending living outdoors.\r\n \r\nFeatures you’ll love include:\r\n• Premium materials and high-end appliances\r\n• Gas fireplace with Schist chimney\r\n• Underfloor heating in all bathrooms\r\n• Built-in Bluetooth speakers (main living)\r\n• Double internal garage and ample storage\r\n• Security gate and CCTV system\r\n \r\nLocated in a family-friendly neighbourhood and zoned for Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College — all within walking distance. Close to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak’n Save, Half Moon Bay Ferry Terminal and Lloyd Elsmore Park.\r\n \r\nBuilt in 2024 in the most popular school zone — it will be in high demand and ready to impress. Contact us today to secure it.",
